 Context
This chunk provides essential information for students enrolled in the CS 490/590 VRAR course at Purdue University, covering administrative details, academic integrity, support resources, and course expectations. It serves as a comprehensive guide for students to understand their responsibilities and the resources available to them throughout the semester.
