final expanded context: CS348 Information Systems - Spring 2026

This schedule is preliminary and subject to change. Text may be clipped in some schedule cells; make sure to adjust column width to see the full content.

### Course Schedule

| Date               | Topic                                                                     | Homework/Project              | Recommended Reading from Textbook                                                                                                                                  |
|--------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| 1/12/2026          | Course logistics, relational model and SQL                                | Project Stage 1 assigned      | 1.1-1.3, 1.8, 1.9, 2.1-2.4, 3.1-3.4 (exclude 3.2.2)                                                                                                           |
| 1/13/2026          | SQL (aggregations)                                                       |                               |                                                                                                                                                                   |
| 1/19/2026          | MLK day, no class                                                        |                               |                                                                                                                                                                   |
| 1/20/2026          | SQL (Joins, set operators)                                               |                               | 4.1, 3.5, 3.6, 3.7, 3.8 (exclude 3.8.8)                                                                                                                         |
| 1/21/2026          | SQL (subqueries)                                                         | Project stage 1 due, HW1 assigned |                                                                                                                                                                   |
| 1/26/2026          | SQL (views, nulls, updates, stored procedures, triggers)                 |                               | 4.2, 5.2, 5.3, 3.9                                                                                                                                              |
| 1/28/2026          | SQL (views, nulls, updates, stored procedures, triggers)                 | HW1 Due, HW2 assigned         |                                                                                                                                                                   |
| 2/2/2026           | SQL (views, nulls, updates, stored procedures, triggers)                 |                               |                                                                                                                                                                   |
| 2/4/2026           | Relational Algebra                                                       |                               | 2.6                                                                                                                                                               |
| 2/9/2026           | Relational Algebra, Databases in the Cloud (Google Cloud Platform)       | HW2 Due, HW3 assigned         |                                                                                                                                                                   |
| 2/11/2026          | SQL in Programming Languages, SQL Injection                               |                               | 5.1, 9.1, 9.2, 9.4.1-9.4.3, 9.6                                                                                                                                    |
| 2/16/2026          | Database Design: Use Cases                                               | Project Stage 2 assigned      |                                                                                                                                                                   |
| 2/18/2026          | Database Design (ER Model)                                               | HW3 due (2/21)                | 6.1-6.7, 6.9-6.10                                                                                                                                              |
| 2/24/2026  (23 for IN)| Evening Lab Exams, ER Model, Functional Dependencies, and Normalization  | HW4 assigned                   |                                                                                                                                                                   |
| 2/26/2026  (25 for IN)| Evening Lab Exams, Functional Dependencies and Normalization             |                               | 7.1-7.4.1, 7.8-7.9                                                                                                                                              |
| 3/3/2026   (2 for IN) | Evening Lab Exams, Functional Dependencies and Normalization             |                               |                                                                                                                                                                   |
