#### Week 15 — Distributed Databases
- **West Lafayette**: April 21 & 23, 2026
- **Indianapolis**: April 20 & 22, 2026
- **Topics**: 
  - OLAP and BigQuery
  - Cluster databases
  - Sharding
  - Replication
  - CAP theorem

---

#### Week 16 — Final Assessments
- **West Lafayette**: April 28 & 30, 2026
- **Indianapolis**: April 27 & 29, 2026
- **Schedule**:
  - Monday: No lecture
  - Tuesday, April 27, 2026 — Midterm Exam 2, 8:00 PM – 9:30 PM
    - Locations:
      - West Lafayette: PHYS 112 and PHYS 114
      - Indianapolis: ES 2107
  - Wednesday: Asynchronous online lecture (TBD)
- **Assignments**: 
  - Project Stage 3 due on May 1, 2026
- **Final Exam**: There is no final exam for this course.

