especially in fields related to data science where you may need to communicate complex information
effectively.  3. **Curriculum Fit**: Look at your overall course load and how COM 21700 fits into
your schedule.   4. **Advisor Consultation**: It's always a good idea to discuss with your academic
advisor how this course aligns with your academic and career goals.  If you believe these reasons
align with your needs, then taking COM 21700 could be beneficial.
