January 19, so ensure you've covered any material related to business understanding.  ### CS440 -
There appears to not be any detailed information provided in this context about CS440. Check your
syllabus or class resources for any material covered during Week 2.  ### CS381 - **Topics Covered**:
- Review any lectures or materials related to searching and sorting algorithms (from January 22).
- Make sure you understand induction and recursion as discussed on January 15.   - Homework 1 is due
on January 29, so begin working on that assignment, focusing on exhaustive problems that may relate
to the past classes.  ### General Steps 1. **Compare Lecture Notes**: Make sure to gather notes from
classmates or the course website to ensure you're on track with what has been discussed. 2.
