- **Topics**: 
  - Course logistics
  - Relational data model
  - Introduction to SQL
- **Assignments**: Project Stage 1 assigned
- **Recommended Reading**: 
  - Sections 1.1–1.3, 1.8, 1.9
  - Sections 2.1–2.4
  - Sections 3.1–3.4 (excluding 3.2.2)

