- **Indianapolis**: January 19 & 21, 2026
- **Special Date**: MLK Day — No Class on January 19, 2026
- **Topics**:
  - SQL joins
  - Set operators
  - SQL subqueries
- **Assignments**: 
  - Project Stage 1 due
  - Homework 1 assigned
- **Recommended Reading**: 
  - Sections 4.1, 3.5, 3.6, 3.7, 3.8 (excluding 3.8.8)

---

#### Week 3 — Advanced SQL
- **West Lafayette**: January 27 & 29, 2026
- **Indianapolis**: January 26 & 28, 2026
- **Topics**: 
  - SQL views
  - NULL values
  - Updates
  - Stored procedures
  - Triggers
- **Assignments**: 
  - Homework 1 due
  - Homework 2 assigned
- **Recommended Reading**: 
  - Sections 4.2, 5.2, 5.3, 3.9

---

#### Week 4 — Relational Algebra
