- **Topics**: 
  - Functional dependencies and normalization (continued)
  - Storage and indexing
- **Assignments**: 
  - Homework 4 due
- **Recommended Reading**: 
  - Section 12.1, Sections 14.1–14.2.2, 14.2.4–14.2.5, Section 14.3 (excluding 14.3.3 and 14.3.4), Sections 14.5–14.7

