late submissions incur a penalty of **35% of the total points** for submissions accepted beyond the
due date. Additionally, it seems that you may also incur a **0.25 points** penalty per day for late
homework based on the CS 34800 course policies. Therefore, it is essential to submit your homework
on time to avoid these penalties.   Please make sure to double-check any specific deadlines and
policies that apply, as these may vary.
